        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Laurey 791, 3 Inch Filigree Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Georgetown Filigree Cabinet Pull adds tasteful decoration to historic kitchens. Orate drawer pulls can also be used on antique furniture. The Filigree Cabinet Pull has 3 inch mounting centers and is 3.5 inches overall. Each pull comes packaged with the mounting hardware \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis cabinet pull is part of the <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=Laurey+Georgetown\">Laurey Georgetown Collection</a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Laurey 3 Inch Georgetown Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 1\" long #8-32 screws and 1-1/2\"  long #8-32 screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
